sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visual editor
  participant D as TypstDocument
  participant P as Project
  participant S as Source editor
  participant Y as Y.Text
  participant W as preview worker
  V->>V: ProseMirror transaction
  V->>D: change(typstChanges(tr), visual editor)
  D->>P: onDidChange
  P->>W: onDidChangeFile → preview.update (≤ every 150 ms)
  Note over V: onDidChange with its own origin: skipped
  D->>S: onDidChange → CodeMirror dispatch
  D->>Y: onDidChange → one Y transaction → server
  W-->>V: changed pages, diagnostics
